                <pb facs="0007" n="III" xml:id="pgIII"/>

                <head>Preface</head>
                <p>This volume was prepared under the direct supervision of the Chief of the Foreign
                    Relations Division, S. Everett Gleason, who also was responsible for the final
                    review of the volume. William Slany compiled the documentation on both of the
                    1946 meetings of the Council of Foreign Ministers: the second session at Paris,
                    April 25–July 12; and the third at New York, November 4–December 12.</p>
                <p>The technical editing of the volume was performed by the Publishing and
                    Reproduction Services Division (Jerome H. Perlmutter, Chief).</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William</hi> M. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Franklin</hi></signed><lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Director, Historical Office</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Bureau of Public Affairs</hi>
                    <lb/>
